("在列表中添加元素", "Adding Elements in Lists"),
("要在列表中添加另一个元素，同时保留列表的连续性，请将元素缩进四个空格或一个制表符，如下例所示。", "To add another element in a list while keeping the list continuous, indent the element by four spaces or one tab, as in the example below."),
