("# LaTex数学公式示例", "# LaTeX Math Formula Examples"),
("**LaTex数学公式**", "**LaTeX math formulas**"),
("如果两个单`$`内或两个双`$$`的`LaTex公式`解析不出来，检查公式格式是否正确。对于两个双`$$`的`LaTex公式`解析，可以在开始的`$$`前面一行多加一个回车换行后，再看看是否解决问题。", "If a `LaTeX formula` inside two single `$` or two double `$$` fails to parse, check that the formula format is correct. For formulas inside double `$$`, try adding an extra blank line before the opening `$$` and see whether that fixes the issue."),
("> 关于`latex数学公式`的,请查看`katex`的文档：https://katex.org/docs/supported ，https://katex.org/docs/support_table  。", "> For `LaTeX math formulas`, see the `KaTeX` documentation: https://katex.org/docs/supported , https://katex.org/docs/support_table ."),
("### 行内公式", "### Inline Formulas"),
("牛顿第二定律：$F = ma$，其中 $a$ 是加速度。", "Newton's second law: $F = ma$, where $a$ is the acceleration."),
