("# 页面属性和自定义变量 (Customized variables)", "# Page Properties and Custom Variables"),
("### 使用页面属性值", "### Using Page Property Values"),
("在markdown文章中，可以通过变量来引用属性值。", "In Markdown articles, variables can reference property values."),
("### 定义页面属性", "### Defining Page Properties"),
("Markdown文件页面属性由一种普遍的采用的front matter方式来设置。", "Markdown file page properties are set with the widely used front matter approach."),
("front matter放在文件头部，采用Yaml语法。front matter部分不会被很多Markdown工具渲染（有些工具不支持），它只是会作为文章或页面page的属性被解析。它的格式是用两个三联短线---开头的单独行和中间的yaml格式内容构成，放在文件头部。", "Front matter is placed at the top of the file using yaml syntax. It is not rendered by most Markdown tools (some do not support it); it is parsed as article or page properties. Its format consists of a line starting with two triple dashes `---`, followed by yaml-format content, placed at the top of the file."),
("**Front-matter的规则**", "**Front-matter rules**"),
("博客文章写作时，经常会自动设置文章的front matter 的参数。", "When writing blog articles, the front matter parameters are often set automatically."),
("参数描述layout布局/title标题/date建立日期/updated更新日期/comments开启文章的评论功能/tags标签（不适用于分页）/categories分类（不适用于分页）/permalink覆盖文章网址，等等。", "Parameter description: layout / title / date (creation date) / updated (update date) / comments (enable article comments) / tags (not for pages) / categories (not for pages) / permalink (override the article URL), etc."),
("其中，分类和标签需要区别一下，分类具有顺序性和层次性，也就是说Foo，Bar不等于Bar，Foo；而标签没有顺序和层次。", "Note the difference between categories and tags: categories are ordered and hierarchical — Foo, Bar is not the same as Bar, Foo — while tags have no order or hierarchy."),
("注意：每个冒号后面是有一个空格的。", "Note: each colon is followed by a space."),
("下面是一个常用博客文章的front matter属性。", "Below are the front matter properties of a common blog article."),
("|配置选项|默认值|描述|", "|Option|Default|Description|"),
("| title\t| Markdown 的文件标题\t| 文章标题，强烈建议填写此选项|", "| title\t| Markdown file title\t| Article title; strongly recommended|"),
("| date\t| 文件创建时的日期时间\t| 发布时间，强烈建议填写此选项，且最好保证全局唯一|", "| date\t| Date and time when the file was created\t| Publish date; strongly recommended, ideally globally unique|"),
("| author\t| 根 _config.yml中的 author\t| 文章作者|", "| author\t| author in the root _config.yml\t| Article author|"),
("| tagName\t| 根 _config.yml中的 author\t| 类型为文章，会格式化显示作者、日期、tags。|", "| tagName\t| author in the root _config.yml\t| Article type; formats the author, date, and tags.|"),
("| img\t| featureImages中的某个值\t| 文章特征图，推荐使用图床(腾讯云、七牛云、又拍云等)来做图片的路径.如: http://xxx.com/xxx.jpg| ", "| img\t| a value in featureImages\t| Featured image; using an image host (Tencent Cloud, Qiniu, Upyun, etc.) for the image path is recommended, e.g. http://xxx.com/xxx.jpg| "),
("| top\t| true\t| 推荐文章（文章是否置顶），如果 top 值为 true，则会作为首页推荐文章| ", "| top\t| true\t| Featured article (pinned or not); if true, shown as a homepage recommendation| "),
("| cover\t| false\t| v1.0.2版本新增，表示该文章是否需要加入到首页轮播封面中| ", "| cover\t| false\t| New in v1.0.2: whether the article is added to the homepage carousel covers| "),
("| coverImg\t| 无\t| v1.0.2版本新增，表示该文章在首页轮播封面需要显示的图片路径，如果没有，则默认使用文章的特色图片| ", "| coverImg\t| none\t| New in v1.0.2: the image path shown in the homepage carousel cover; falls back to the featured image if unset| "),
("| password\t| 无\t| 文章阅读密码，如果要对文章设置阅读验证密码的话，就可以设置 password 的值，该值必须是用 SHA256 加密后的密码，防止被他人识破。前提是在主题的 config.yml 中激活了 verifyPassword 选项| ", "| password\t| none\t| Article reading password; if set, it must be a SHA256-hashed value to avoid being guessed. Requires the verifyPassword option enabled in the theme's config.yml| "),
("| toc\t| true\t| 是否开启 TOC，可以针对某篇文章单独关闭 TOC 的功能。前提是在主题的 config.yml 中激活了 toc 选项| ", "| toc\t| true\t| Whether TOC is enabled; can be disabled per article. Requires the toc option enabled in the theme's config.yml| "),
("| mathjax\t| false\t| 是否开启数学公式支持 ，本文章是否开启 mathjax，且需要在主题的 _config.yml 文件中也需要开启才行| ", "| mathjax\t| false\t| Whether math formula support is enabled for this article; must also be enabled in the theme's _config.yml| "),
("| summary\t| 无\t| 文章摘要，自定义的文章摘要内容，如果这个属性有值，文章卡片摘要就显示这段文字，否则程序会自动截取文章的部分内容作为摘要| ", "| summary\t| none\t| Article summary; if set, the card shows this text, otherwise the program auto-truncates content as the summary| "),
("| categories\t| 无\t| 文章分类，本主题的分类表示宏观上大的分类，只建议一篇文章一个分类| ", "| categories\t| none\t| Article categories; this theme treats them as broad top-level groups, one per article is recommended| "),
("| tags\t| 无\t| 文章标签，一篇文章可以多个标签| ", "| tags\t| none\t| Article tags; an article can have multiple tags| "),
("| reprintPolicy\t| cc_by\t| 文章转载规则， 可以是 cc_by, cc_by_nd, cc_by_sa, cc_by_nc, cc_by_nc_nd, cc_by_nc_sa, cc0, noreprint 或 pay 中的一个| ", "| reprintPolicy\t| cc_by\t| Reprint policy; one of cc_by, cc_by_nd, cc_by_sa, cc_by_nc, cc_by_nc_nd, cc_by_nc_sa, cc0, noreprint, or pay| "),
("### yaml语法", "### yaml Syntax"),
("Markdown 文件头部定义有个front matter部分，这部分内容使用yaml语法。", "The front matter section at the top of a Markdown file uses yaml syntax."),
("**简单的yaml语法**", "**Simple yaml syntax**"),
("YAML 中有 3 种数据类型——对象/字典、数组和纯量，其中纯量中又包含了字符串、整数、浮点数、布尔值、空值、时间和日期。", "YAML has 3 data types: objects/mappings, arrays, and scalars; scalars include strings, integers, floats, booleans, nulls, times, and dates."),
("> YAML 支持编写注释，使用 # 表示行注释，直到行末尾都是注释内容，类似于 Python 语法中的行注释。YAML 是大小写敏感的，在编写时要注意大小写。", "> YAML supports comments: `#` starts a line comment that runs to the end of the line, like line comments in Python. YAML is case-sensitive, so mind your casing."),
("基本由`键`和`值`构成。`键`，必须是由 `a-zA-Z0-9_` 这些`英文+数字+下划线`构成，不要用中文。`值`，可以用各种字符串，中文也可以。", "It basically consists of `keys` and `values`. A `key` must consist of `a-zA-Z0-9_` (letters + digits + underscore), not Chinese characters. A `value` can be any string, including Chinese."),
("YAML 中的对象（mapping）类似于 Python 中的字典，它是一个由 key 和 value 组成的键值对。其中 key 可以是字符串、整数、浮点数，value 可以是 YAML 中的任意数据类型。", "An object (mapping) in YAML is like a dictionary in Python: key-value pairs. Keys can be strings, integers, or floats; values can be any YAML data type."),
("书写对象时，key 不需要加双引号，且 key 后面紧跟英文冒号，冒号后面必须接一个空格。", "When writing an object, keys need no double quotes; a key is followed directly by an English colon, and the colon must be followed by a space."),
("`键-值对`(key-value)，如，", "`key-value pairs`, e.g.,"),
("`键-列表值`，缩进为2个空格，同层级的字段数据是左侧对齐的。如果列表值比较简单，可以将列表值放在方`[]`中间。如，", "`key-list value`: indented by 2 spaces, with same-level fields left-aligned. If the list is simple, it can be written inside square brackets `[]`. E.g.,"),
("`键-字典`，子元素进行缩进，或构成嵌套。多个`键值对`，就是`字典`。如，", "`key-dictionary`: child elements are indented or nested. Multiple `key-value pairs` form a `dictionary`. E.g.,"),
("**字符串**", "**Strings**"),
("YAML 中单行字符串的 3 种基本写法如下所示。用单引号或者双引号包裹，也可以直接写字符串内容，无须引号包裹。", "The 3 basic ways to write single-line strings in YAML are shown below: wrapped in single or double quotes, or written directly without quotes."),
("在一些特殊的场景中，如字符串中涉及多行，可以考虑使用 `>` 或者 `|`。比如，", "In special cases such as multi-line strings, consider using `>` or `|`. For example,"),
("**日期与时间**", "**Dates and Times**"),
("日期类 date 是精确到天，时间类 datetime 是精确到微秒，二者的书写格式必须遵循 ISO 8601 标准。", "`date` is precise to the day and `datetime` to the microsecond; both must follow the ISO 8601 standard."),
("YAML 中日期与时间的写法如下所示。", "Dates and times in YAML are written as follows."),
("> 更多Yaml语法，参考下面链接。", "> For more yaml syntax, see the links below."),
("> [Yaml官网](https://yaml.org/)", "> [Yaml official site](https://yaml.org/)"),
("> [Yaml官方文档 - 规范1.2.2](https://yaml.org/spec/1.2.2/)", "> [Yaml official documentation - spec 1.2.2](https://yaml.org/spec/1.2.2/)"),
("> [YAML入门教程](https://www.runoob.com/w3cnote/yaml-intro.html)", "> [YAML getting started tutorial](https://www.runoob.com/w3cnote/yaml-intro.html)"),
("### css语法", "### CSS Syntax"),
("css语法支持对某个MD文件部分内容的颜色、线条等格式进行修饰。因为MD文件会被转为HTML页面，所以支持CSS语法修饰内容样式。", "CSS syntax can decorate parts of an MD file (colors, borders, etc.). Because an MD file is converted to an HTML page, CSS can style the content."),
("在MD文件前面部分或者文件后面加入CSS样式定义。<br>", "Add CSS style definitions at the beginning or end of the MD file.<br>"),
("每一条样式类型的定义，都要加`.page `，这样就只影响自己内容的局限部分，以避免影响整个页面其他部分。<br>", "Every style rule should be prefixed with `.page ` so it only affects the scoped part of your content, avoiding side effects on the rest of the page.<br>"),
("比如，将文件内表格左边加空白，使表格整体向右偏移20px个像素。鼠标经过表格某行时给它着色，鼠标移走后取消着色。", "For example, add left padding to a table so it shifts right by 20px; color a table row on hover and remove the color when the mouse leaves."),
("> 注：", "> Note:"),
("表格的标签名为 `table`，表格的行的标签为`tr`，表格的格子的标签为`td` ，", "The tag for tables is `table`, for table rows `tr`, and for table cells `td`,"),
("6个级别标题的标签为 `h1`, `h2`, `h3`, `h4`, `h5`, `h6` ，", "the tags for the 6 heading levels are `h1`, `h2`, `h3`, `h4`, `h5`, `h6`,"),
("代码和关键字的标签为 `code`，围栏的标签为 `pre` 或 `pre code` ，", "the tag for code and keywords is `code`, and for fenced blocks `pre` or `pre code`,"),
("加粗的标签为 `strong` ，或 `b` ，", "bold uses `strong` or `b`,"),
("斜体的标签为 `em` ，", "italic uses `em`,"),
("链接的标签为 `a` ，", "links use `a`,"),
("图片链接的标签为 `img` ，", "image links use `img`,"),
("分割线的标签为 `hr` ，", "horizontal rules use `hr`,"),
("段落的标签为 `p` ，", "paragraphs use `p`,"),
("无序列表的标签为 `ul` ， 每一个列表行的表签 `li` ，", "unordered lists use `ul`, with each item `li`,"),
("有序列表的标签为 `ol` ， 每一个列表行的表签 `li` ，", "ordered lists use `ol`, with each item `li`,"),
("引用的标签为 `blockquote` ，", "blockquotes use `blockquote`,"),
("highlight的代码块的标签为 `pre code`，它的最外层className为 `hljs`，行号的className为 `hljs-ln-numbers` 。另外，因为支持行号，所以代码块里面部分也包含 `table`, `tr`, `td` 等标签。", "highlighted code blocks use `pre code`, with the outer className `hljs` and the line numbers className `hljs-ln-numbers`. Since line numbers are supported, code blocks also contain `table`, `tr`, `td` tags."),
("svg图的外层标签为 `svg` 。", "SVG figures use the outer tag `svg`."),
("更多请参考HTML文档。", "For more, refer to the HTML documentation."),
("如果想加一个空白行，直接用标签 <code>&lt;br&gt;</code> 。", "To add a blank line, use the tag <code>&lt;br&gt;</code>."),
("如果有多个部分有相同的标签，但只想对其中一个的样式进行修饰，怎么办？", "What if multiple parts share the same tag but you only want to style one of them?"),
("我们可以定义一个样式，增加一个对标签 `<tag class=\"c1\">` 和 </tag>，将要修饰的内容放在这两个标签之间，并给样式类型起个名字 `c1`。", "Define a style: wrap the content to style with a pair of `<tag class=\"c1\">` and `</tag>` tags, and name the style class `c1`."),
("这样，在样式定义中，可以使用 `.page .c1 tr:hover`，表示在 类型 `page` 标签下的 类型 `c1` 下的 表格的行 `tr`的鼠标经过`hover`的样式定义，改变它的颜色。", "Then in the style definition you can use `.page .c1 tr:hover`, which defines the hover style of table rows `tr` under the `page` class and the `c1` class, changing their color."),
("下面举个例子。将选定的一个表格定义放在`tag`标签内，`<tag class=\"c1\">` 和 </tag>之间，前后都加一行空行。然后我们在md文件后面加`<style>...</style>`，在里面定义一个新的样式 `c1`，将表格向右偏移50个像素50px，表格表单头背景色改为翠绿色，并且鼠标经过表格行时改变背景色为品粉色。", "Here is an example: put a table inside `<tag class=\"c1\">` and `</tag>` with a blank line before and after. Then add `<style>...</style>` at the end of the MD file defining a new style `c1` that shifts the table right by 50px, sets the header background to jade green, and changes the row background to pink on hover."),
("另外，增加一个`tag`标签，将代码块放在`<tag class=\"c2\">` 和 </tag>之间，前后都加一行空行。然后我们在md文件后面加`<style>...</style>`，在里面定义一个新的样式 `c2`，改变代码块标签 `pre code`的背景色为翠绿色，再改变代码块的行号颜色为浅蓝色。", "Also, wrap a code block with `<tag class=\"c2\">` and `</tag>` with a blank line before and after, then add `<style>...</style>` at the end of the MD file defining a new style `c2` that sets the `pre code` background to jade green and the line numbers to light blue."),
("这两处改动，都不会影响到前面其它部分的样式，其它部分内容的样式还保持原样。代码关键字带有颜色，是因为自动判断内容为`html`语言，自动被`highlight JS`语法高亮了。", "Neither change affects the styles of other parts; everything else keeps its original style. The colored keywords appear because the content is auto-detected as `html` and highlighted by `highlight.js`."),
("这个样式类名可以随便定义，`字母+数字`的组合，也可以包含中短线`-`，比如前面定义的样式名`c1`和`c2`，在`<style>`里用样式类名时，前面要多加一个点`.`，这表示它是样式类名或className ，它是网页 CSS 选择器的常见的一种选择器。更多请参考Web编程语言HTML和CSS文档。", "Style class names are arbitrary: `letters+digits` combinations, possibly with hyphens `-`, like `c1` and `c2` above. In `<style>`, prefix a class name with a dot `.` to indicate a class name (className), a common CSS selector. For more, refer to the HTML and CSS documentation."),
("这个标签和样式尽量少用，非不得已时，简单使用一些。如果一个MD文件里使用太多样式定义，就会让MD文件失去了简单易读的特性，变成了另类的HTML网页编程了。", "Use these tags and styles sparingly, and keep them simple unless necessary. Too many style definitions make an MD file lose its simplicity and readability, turning it into HTML programming."),
